WEBVTT

1.1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.396
Step 1. Open the referral page from a referral list.

1.2
00:00:03.396 --> 00:00:06.663
You can share the patient's records with the referral,

1.3
00:00:06.663 --> 00:00:10.611
and everyone who can open the referral can then see them.

2.1
00:00:10.611 --> 00:00:14.382
Step 2. Under Shared records, select Add record,

2.2
00:00:14.382 --> 00:00:19.004
then choose a kind of record in Record type, such as Diagnosis.

2.3
00:00:19.004 --> 00:00:24.198
You can share an accessible record that belongs to this patient.

3.1
00:00:24.198 --> 00:00:30.098
Step 3. Find the record. For a file, first choose where it is in Files from.

3.2
00:00:30.098 --> 00:00:36.322
For a diagnosis, Care shows Records from when there is a receiving encounter.

4.1
00:00:36.322 --> 00:00:40.374
Step 4. Select the Select button on the record's row,

4.2
00:00:40.374 --> 00:00:43.961
then Add record at the bottom right of the dialog.

4.3
00:00:43.961 --> 00:00:49.697
Care shows Record shared with referral and lists it under Shared records.
